charout at 1 : C1=0 w15 C=0 w16
   [line1|line2|XYZ]
lineout at line 1 : L1=0 w17 L=0 w22
   [line1|line2|new|tail|]
seek then charout : S=2 w2 C=0 w14
   [line1|line2|Q]
write append : C1=0 w15 L2=0 w18
   [line1|line2|abcd|]
charout past the end : C30=0 w16 L=0 w20
   [line1|line2|farend|]
record append : L1=0 w13 C3=0 w14
   [AAAABBBBab  Z]
lines count after a read past the end : NOTREADY 2 READY
